# LaneLink stadium visuals (binding)

**Hard rule for every further modification of game / match code** (`game/**`, `drawMatch`, HUD, building placement, upgrade previews, new features): always load and render the approved freigestellte building icons below for **all three colors** (blue / red / grey). Do **not** draw placeholder booths, regenerate stand art, or invent alternate Fanshop/Bierstand graphics unless the user explicitly requests a redesign.

Applies to: match / gameplay implementations, visual work, and **any** subsequent code change that touches buildings or stand rendering.

## Background

- Always use **`game/public/assets/stadium-floodlight-derby-bg.jpg`** as the match backdrop.
- Do **not** redraw a green pitch, flat abstract field, or alternate stadium BG as the primary scene.
- Keep the blank top **Anzeigetafel** area free for HUD / score overlay (do not paint score text into the bitmap).

## Fan blocks (Tribünen)

- Place the freigestellte tribune assets **on top of** that background, scaled to the playfield layout:
  - Heim (left): `game/public/assets/tribune-block-blue.png`
  - Neutral (center): `game/public/assets/tribune-block-grey.png`
  - Gäste (right): `game/public/assets/tribune-block-red.png`
- Units, buildings, gang, and combat stay **game-rendered** on/around these blocks — do not bake fans into the tribune PNGs.
- Optional sheet (all three): `game/public/assets/tribune-blocks-sheet.png`

## Currency HUD symbols

Always use these **logo-only** freigestellte icons for match currencies (no baked-in numbers or labels — counts come from live HUD text):

- Gold → `docs/mockups/icons/ui/currency-gold.png` (runtime: `game/public/icons/ui/currency-gold.png`)
- Bier → `docs/mockups/icons/ui/currency-bier.png`
- Fanartikel → `docs/mockups/icons/ui/currency-fanartikel.png`
- Sicherheit → `docs/mockups/icons/ui/currency-sicherheit.png`

Do **not** redraw ad-hoc coin/mug/scarf/shield glyphs in canvas when these assets are available.

## Bierstand buildings (default — binding, finalized)

**Status: freigegeben / final.** These are the only Bierstand assets to use in code.

For **every** future match / building render, upgrade preview, new game creation, and **every later game-code change**, always use these freigestellte Bierstand icons for **blau, rot und grau** — do **not** invent new booth art or regenerate from scratch unless the user explicitly asks for a redesign:

| Farbe | Pfade (Lv1–5) |
|---|---|
| Heim / blau | `game/public/icons/stands/bier-blue-{1..5}.png` |
| Gäste / rot | `game/public/icons/stands/bier-red-{1..5}.png` |
| Neutral / grau | `game/public/icons/stands/bier-grey-{1..5}.png` |
| Unfarbig / Fallback | `game/public/icons/stands/bier-{1..5}.png` (= grau) |

Canonical mockup copies (same pixels): `docs/mockups/icons/stands-colored/bier-{blue\|red\|grey}-{1..5}.png`  
Sheets: `docs/mockups/icons/stands-colored/sheet-bier-{blue\|red\|grey}.png`

**Progression contract (do not regress):**

- Lv1: Tracht-Vendor hinter einfacher Theke, 1 Maßglas auf Theke + 1 in der Hand, **1** braunes Fass mit grauen Reifen **vor** dem Stand
- Lv2: Dach/Rahmen, Vendor mit Kappe + Hosenträger, Gläser auf Theke, **2** Fässer um den Stand
- Lv3: Markise (Teamfarbe/weiß), Lichterkette, Brezel am Pfosten, **3** Fässer
- Lv4: Neon-**BIER**-Schild, 2 Vendor (männlich + Dirndl), gestreifte Front, **4** Fässer um den Stand (keine Fässer auf der Theke)
- Lv5: aufwendigeres Neon, gleiche 2 Vendor, Gläser auf Theke, **5** Fässer um den Stand

Teamfarbe steckt in Theke / Markise / Neon — Fässer bleiben braun mit grauen Reifen.

## Fanshop buildings (default — binding, finalized)

**Status: freigegeben / final.** These are the only Fanshop assets to use in code.

For **every** future match / building render, upgrade preview, new game creation, and **every later game-code change**, always use these freigestellte Fanshop icons for **blau, rot und grau** — do **not** invent new shop art or regenerate from scratch unless the user explicitly asks for a redesign:

| Farbe | Pfade (Lv1–5) |
|---|---|
| Heim / blau | `game/public/icons/stands/fanshop-blue-{1..5}.png` |
| Gäste / rot | `game/public/icons/stands/fanshop-red-{1..5}.png` |
| Neutral / grau | `game/public/icons/stands/fanshop-grey-{1..5}.png` |
| Unfarbig / Fallback | `game/public/icons/stands/fanshop-{1..5}.png` (= grau) |

Canonical mockup copies: `docs/mockups/icons/stands-colored/fanshop-{blue\|red\|grey}-{1..5}.png`  
Sheets: `docs/mockups/icons/stands-colored/sheet-fanshop-{blue\|red\|grey}.png`

**Progression contract (do not regress):**

- Lv1: Holz-Schalständer (**braunes** Gerüst, nicht teamfarbig lackiert), wenige Teamfarbe/weiß-Schals, **1** Vendor **neben** dem Ständer — **keine** Fähnchen
- Lv2: Theke ohne Markise, Trikots + Schal auf der Theke, **1** Vendor dahinter, **ein** kleines Fähnchen am Tisch erlaubt
- Lv3: gestreifte Markise (Teamfarbe/weiß), Dachbalken/Rahmen in Teamfarbe (blau bzw. passend), Lampions, mehr Ware, **1** Vendor — **keine** Fähnchen
- Lv4: Schild **FANSHOP** in Teamfarbe, Theke/Basis eher **grau** (nicht voll teamfarbig lackiert), 2 Vendor, braune Holzkisten, gestreifte Markise — **keine** Fähnchen
- Lv5: Neon-**FANSHOP** in Teamfarbe, 2 Vendor, max. Ware, braune Holzkisten, Basis grau — **keine** Fähnchen

**Vendor:** Verkäufer tragen immer ein **Fantrikot in Vereinsfarbe** (blau bzw. rot); grau/neutral bleibt grau.  
Teamfarbe steckt in Schals / Trikots / Markise / Schild / Neon — Schalständer-Holz und Holzkisten bleiben braun. Ordner-Stände sind **nicht** durch diese Regel ersetzt.

## Out of scope / do not regress

- Older assets (`stadium-floodlight-bg.jpg`, `stadium-floodlight-empty-bg.jpg`) are archives only — not the default match BG.
- Do not put text on crowd flags in new BG art.
- Do not replace the approved Bierstand or Fanshop defaults above with older sheet art or new generations without an explicit redesign ask.
- When implementing or modifying stand rendering in code, **wire these finalized PNG paths** — never fall back to procedural/canvas booth drawings while these files exist.
